            sqlQuery:
                ```sql
                select apex_util.prepare_url(
                           apex_page.get_url(
                               p_application => 200,
                               p_page => 175,
                               p_items => 'P175_REQUEST_ID',
                               p_values => :P52_REQUEST_ID
                           ),
                           p_checksum_type => 'SESSION'
                       ) as review_url
                  from dual
                ```
